1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:11,760
We just have to follow the floating stones

25
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:14,480
to the entry of the first trial.

26
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,600
Old ghost Duanmu,

27
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,840
are we inside the Ancient God's body ?

28
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,400
This is just an entrance,

29
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,000
a passage leading to the Ancient God's body.

30
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,320
It may be

31
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:31,240
just a single hair of the Ancient God.

32
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,080
Stop with your nonsense.

33
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:38,000
If this is just a single hair,

34
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,160
wouldn't the Ancient God's body

35
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,200
be larger than planet Suzaku ?

36
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,600
An adult Ancient God's body

37
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:47,440
is many times larger than planet Suzaku.

38
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,520
Then how long will it take to cross it ?

39
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,520
Where is the Ancient God's bag of holding ?

40
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:57,120
Ancient Gods didn't use bags of holding.

41
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,840
They kept their artifacts

42
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,880
hidden within their own bodies.

43
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,120
New guy,

44
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:04,920
since it's your first time in the Land of the Ancient God,

45
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,440
don't be too greedy.

46
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,320
Don't put on airs,

47
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:14,040
aren't we all here for the Soul Transformation Pills ?

48
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,480
You're not wrong,

49
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,520
our goal this time

50
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,960
is indeed the Soul Transformation Pills.

51
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:22,240
The rumors say that after completing all the trials,

52
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:25,400
they can be found within the Ancient God's meridians.

53
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
However...

54
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:31,400
we aren't here just for the Soul Transformation Pills.

55
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,240
Oh ?

56
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,200
What do you mean by that ?

57
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,360
There are countless treasures here.

58
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,680
Even though the Ancient God is dead,

59
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:42,240
his Divine Sense remains.

60
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,800
It's just in a dormant state.

61
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,640
If one can enter its body

62
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:50,640
and obtain its memories

63
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:51,720
then

64
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,520
any spell stored in its memory

65
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,880
would be incredibly powerful

66
00:03:57,640 --> 00:04:00,320
in the present day and age.

67
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,200
These Soul Formation Devil Lords

68
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,600
came here before but failed to pass the trials

69
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:10,480
and spent a 1000 years preparing for this trip.

70
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,840
It shows how dangerous this place is...

71
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,600
I must find a way to escape quickly...

72
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,960
What are these stars ?

73
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,680
Why is my Ji Realm so restless ?

74
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:25,680
Kid,

75
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,440
don't overthink it.

76
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,960
Try not to provoke it,

77
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:33,320
it's been asleep for thousands of years.

78
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,120
It's just a beast,

79
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,120
it's not worth mentioning.
